#. <CLT 4>こんな危ない物を気にしてないで、
#. 事件の手がかりを見つけないと…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This thing is dangerous, but I don't have time to\n"
"worry about it. I need to look for clues!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>入口は…鉄の塊で塞がれてしまっている…
#. 銀行の金庫みたいな厳重さだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The entrance is still blocked by that giant hunk of\n"
"metal. It's as strong as any bank vault...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>レターケースだ…
#. 今回の事件には関係ないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mailbox... It has nothing to do with the case this\n"
"time.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな危ない物を気にしてないで、
#. 事件の手がかりを見つけないと…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This thing is dangerous, but I don't have time to\n"
"worry about it. I need to look for clues!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

